  "details": "I've been on VRChat for a year or two now. I've notice a common thing people want on this game. The people want more custom sticker and emoji slots so people could show off more of their finds of funny memes. I was thinking instead of 18 stickers and emojis it could be 30. the reason I say 30 is because on the wheel there is a sorting thing of 3 so that would be 10 per sorting thing. This will allow all VRChat+ players to be happy with the game and make it feel like it was worth buying because some people don't think its worth it but I believe it is and I want this game and community to grow in any way possible",
